      "text": {
        "jp": "お兄ちゃん、びっくりしないでね！\r\nいっぱい練習をして、わたし、とうとう６０回も跳びました！",
        "official_en": "Okay, mister! I practiced a whole bunch and set a new record: 60 jumps! It would pretty much be rude to break it!",
        "real_en": "Don't be too surprised, mister! I've been practicing a lot, and I finally managed 60 jumps!"
      },
