      "text": {
        "jp": "さすがのお兄ちゃんでも、この記録は抜けないと思う。\r\nそれでも挑戦する？",
        "official_en": "Not that I think you can, anyhow! But feel free to tire yourself out!",
        "real_en": "I don't think even you can beat this record. Want to try anyway?"
